      "finding": "Level 4 misdescribes its control: the slider is eta (proportion of acute cases that recover), not a recovery speed.",
      "kind": "unsupported",
      "level": 4,
      "severity": "blocking",
      "suggestion": "Relabel the control as 'Proportion of acute cases that recover directly' (model id eta, term +i*eta*r2 in dr/dt), and change the What-if to 'What if a larger share of acute cases recovered directly?' so the words match the equation; keep the recovered-peak measurement if desired.",
      "term": "eta in dr/dt = + i * eta * r2"
    }
